          <h2>Legacy System Migration</h2>
          <p>We have significant expertise in helping organisations move from legacy systems to the latest technologies. As well as developing the new solution for you, we can transfer data from the existing system and prepare your organisation for the switchover from the old to the new system.</p>
          <h3>Our Migration Process</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Comprehensive analysis of existing systems and data</li>
            <li>Detailed migration planning and risk assessment</li>
            <li>Secure and validated data transfer</li>
            <li>Parallel running and testing before switchover</li>
            <li>Staff training and post-migration support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn secondary">Discuss Your Requirements</a>
        </div>
      </div>

